WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.741
(twangy electric guitar
playing "Jingle Bells")

00:00:04.741 --> 00:00:05.888
- Is that mistletoe?

00:00:05.888 --> 00:00:07.118
I'm on the naughty list.

00:00:07.118 --> 00:00:08.410
Don't tell.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:11.440
I'm Santa's second wife, get it?

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:13.861
The invitation said festive attire.

00:00:15.236 --> 00:00:16.559
- Did I hear you say Merry Christmas?

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:18.041
Because it's Happy Holidays.
(organ music)

00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:19.206
It's a holiday party.

00:00:19.206 --> 00:00:21.739
I see a lot of green, I see a lot of red.

00:00:21.739 --> 00:00:22.875
Where's the blue, man?

00:00:22.875 --> 00:00:23.884
You like potatoes?

00:00:23.884 --> 00:00:25.557
I like potatoes a latkes.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.107
(fancy, metropolitan music)

00:00:27.107 --> 00:00:28.930
- I've had this on hold since July.

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:30.825
Don't I look fantastic?

00:00:30.825 --> 00:00:33.713
You wore a sweater, that's cute.

00:00:33.713 --> 00:00:36.456
Oh thank you, yes, it
took my stylist four hours

00:00:36.456 --> 00:00:38.080
but obviously it was worth it.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.265
Oh, we're just stopping by.

00:00:39.265 --> 00:00:41.912
So many parties to get to, aha!

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:44.778
- I get it, I'm not wearing a dress.

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:45.997
("Dance of the Sugar Plum
Fairy" by Tchaikovsky)

00:00:45.997 --> 00:00:46.649
I don't care.

00:00:46.649 --> 00:00:48.117
Jesus wasn't born in sequins.

00:00:48.947 --> 00:00:50.687
Sure, I dressed up, I wore white.

00:00:50.687 --> 00:00:52.233
Oh, that dress is so cute!

00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:53.374
I bet you're freezing.

00:00:54.274 --> 00:00:55.754
(jazzy version of "Deck The Halls")

00:00:55.754 --> 00:00:57.445
- Is that a real Christmas tree?

00:00:57.445 --> 00:00:59.361
Those are so bad for the environment.

00:00:59.361 --> 00:01:00.961
Did you buy those ornaments?

00:01:00.961 --> 00:01:03.060
You know you can DIY them.

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.197
It's just with the money
you spent on catering,

00:01:05.197 --> 00:01:07.453
we could've fed a lot of hungry people.

00:01:07.453 --> 00:01:08.958
But the shrimp was sensational.

00:01:09.728 --> 00:01:11.271
- Who doesn't love Christmas?

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.907
I don't know why people don't
wear red and green all year.

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:15.532
They go so well together.

00:01:15.532 --> 00:01:17.029
We should do a secret santa.

00:01:17.029 --> 00:01:18.027
Caroling.

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:20.477
Let's go caroling, I'll drive.

00:01:20.477 --> 00:01:21.450
Do you like my antlers?

00:01:21.450 --> 00:01:22.706
I ordered them in bulk.

00:01:22.706 --> 00:01:23.507
Do you want a pair?

00:01:23.507 --> 00:01:24.791
I can get you a pair.

00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:26.487
- What, you've never seen mean girls?

00:01:26.487 --> 00:01:28.776
- Why have one day when
you can have eight?

00:01:28.776 --> 00:01:29.807
You know what I'm saying?

00:01:29.807 --> 00:01:31.508
- What should I hashtag this party?

